codex delete --worktree session: `--worktree` supports new interactive sessions, `web2codex fork`, `web2codex exec`, and `web2codex exec fork`
web2codex fork --worktree: `web2codex fork --worktree` requires an explicit session ID
web2codex fork --worktree --last: `web2codex fork --worktree` requires an explicit session ID
web2codex exec resume --worktree session: `--worktree` cannot resume an existing session; use `web2codex exec fork --worktree`
web2codex exec review --worktree: `--worktree` is not supported for code review
web2codex resume --worktree session: `--worktree` supports new interactive sessions, `web2codex fork`, `web2codex exec`, and `web2codex exec fork`
